## Admission

::vfx{type="flicker"}
@narrator: You sit down on the floor because the floor is the only thing that isn't moving.
@nell{emotion="numb"}: I'm the new nurse. I'm the new nurse. I have to do the round at three.
@maud: Of course you do. Up you get. Arm out. That's it.
@narrator: The needle is gentle. The bed is warm. The ledger in the records room gains a line, in wet ink: ARDEN, E. Bed 14.
::set{run.fate = "broken"}
